    "teacher_markdown": "**Student Takeaways:**\r\n- Students recognize how string operations can be efficiently used for data filtering in real-world scenarios, such as searching for specific patterns in textual data.\r\n\r\n**Possible Misconceptions and/or Difficulties:**\r\n- There may be confusion about how to apply the str.endswith() method to columns containing non-string data types or missing values.\r\n",
